2. Above writ petition is filed seeking for following reliefs:
(i) To set aside OM dated 02.02.2022 in no.KIADB/LAQ/1298/2021-22 passed respondent no.2 as per Annexure-V;
(ii) Direct respondents no.1 to 3 consider claim of petitioners for disbursement of compensation amount as per award dated 05.07.2021 (Annexure-Q) in respect of land bearing survey no.481 measuring 2 acres 12 guntas situated at Cheelur Village, Maralavadi Hobli, Kanakapura Taluk,
Ramanagar District by incorporating their names in said award as per representations/application by petitioners (Annexures-T and U);
(iia) To set aside General Award dated 05.07.2021 as per Annexure Q no.KIADB-LAQ-350/2021-22 by issue of writ in nature of certiorari or any other writ or direction as case may be.

(iii) Consequently it is further prayed to issue direction to respondents no.1 to 3 to refer claim for enhancement of compensation and apportionment of compensation and disputes as to apportionment;
(iv) Issue direction to respondents no.1 to 3 prohibiting them to disburse any compensation amount to respondent no.4 under guise of award dated 05.07.2021 in no.KIADB-L-AQ 350/201-22 as per Annexure-Q etc.
